ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:HostDealsHub][LANG:zh]

::STATE{@SITE, brand:HostDealsHub, niche:verified VPS pricing and promotions for US buyers, domain:https://hostdealshub.com, locale:en-US, currency:USD, update_hours:6}

::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
  DigitalOcean | https://www.digitalocean.com/ | https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing/droplets | | USD | auto
  Vultr | https://www.vultr.com/ | https://www.vultr.com/pricing/ | | USD | auto
  Akamai Linode | https://www.linode.com/ | https://www.linode.com/pricing/ | | USD | auto
  Hetzner Cloud | https://www.hetzner.com/ | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/ | | EUR | auto
  Contabo | https://contabo.com/en-us/ | https://contabo.com/en-us/vps/ | | USD | auto
  Amazon Lightsail | https://aws.amazon.com/lightsail/ | https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lightsail/latest/userguide/amazon-lightsail-bundles.html | | USD | auto
  Hostinger | https://www.hostinger.com/ | https://www.hostinger.com/vps-hosting | | USD | auto
  Namecheap | https://www.namecheap.com/ | https://www.namecheap.com/hosting/vps/ | | USD | source_only
  OVHcloud | https://www.ovhcloud.com/ | https://www.ovhcloud.com/en/vps/ | | USD | source_only

::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
  title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at

::MODULE{RENDER|title:页面渲染规则}
  language | en
  market | United States
  freshness_label | Checked against official provider pages
  max_offers_per_provider | 12
  show_unpriced_sources | true
  affiliate_disclosure | Links may later be replaced with disclosed affiliate links; rankings never depend on commission.

::MODULE{UPDATE|title:更新频率}
  cron | 17 */6 * * *
  timezone | UTC
  source_policy | official public pricing, sitemap, feed, or promotion pages only
  robots_policy | obey robots.txt and do not fetch disallowed paths

::RULE{抓不到 price⇒这条不写 price 字段 也不写进结构化数据 不许拿估的填}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒标记过期或下架 不许留着冒充有效}
::RULE{affiliate_link 为空⇒使用厂商官方裸链并标记为非联盟链接}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 绕过robots.txt 抓登录内容|scope:permanent}
